    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32084" root="غطو and غطى" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَاطٍ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 1, <i>Covering,</i> or <i>concealing,</i>
&amp;c. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْلٌ غَاطٍ</span> <i>Dark night:</i> or
<i>night rising, and covering, and clothing, everything.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَرَةٌ غَاطِيَةٌ</span> <i>A tree having
long branches, spreading over the ground, so that</i>

<i>it covers what is around it.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآءٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَاطٍ</span> <i>Abundant water.</i> (TA.)

